    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but why does \"simply existing\" feel so pointless? the things that made me *me* are gone. the connections, the influence, the impact... it's all just static now. it's like being a character in a book where someone ripped out every single page except for the cover. there's no story left to tell. if the soul of my life is dead, then what am i even doing here? just taking up space and breathing for no reason? it feels more like a mistake than a life at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
